#: engines/fibs/kbgfibs.cpp:212
#, kde-format
msgid "FIBS backgammon engine"
msgstr "FIBS backgammon motor"

#: engines/fibs/kbgfibs.cpp:213
#, kde-format
msgid "FIBS Engine"
msgstr "FIBS motor"

#: engines/fibs/kbgfibs.cpp:233 kbgboard.cpp:173
#, kde-format
msgid "Options"
msgstr "Opcije"

#: engines/fibs/kbgfibs.cpp:234
#, kde-format
msgid "Automatic Messages"
msgstr "Automatske poruke"

#: engines/fibs/kbgfibs.cpp:242
#, kde-format
msgid "Show copy of personal messages in main window"
msgstr "Prikaži kopiju ličnih poruka u glavnom prozoru"

#: engines/fibs/kbgfibs.cpp:243
#, kde-format
msgid "Automatically request player info on invitation"
msgstr "Automatski zahtjev informacije o igraču pri pozivu"

#: engines/fibs/kbgfibs.cpp:245
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Usually, all messages sent directly to you by other players are displayed "
"only in the chat window. Check this box if you would like to get a copy of "
"these messages in the main window."
msgstr ""
"Obično, sve poruke koje su drugi igrači poslali direktno vama su prikazane "
"samo u prozoru za ćaskanje. Popunite ovu kućicu ako biste željeli da "
"dobijete kopiju tih poruka i u glavnom prozoru."

#: engines/fibs/kbgfibs.cpp:248
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Check this box if you would like to receive information on players that "
"invite you to games."
msgstr ""
"Popunite ovu kućicu ako biste željeli da primate informacije o igračima koji "
"vas pozivaju u igre."

#: engines/fibs/kbgfibs.cpp:265
#, kde-format
msgid "Start match:"
msgstr "Započni meč:"

#: engines/fibs/kbgfibs.cpp:266
#, kde-format
msgid "Win match:"
msgstr "Pobjeda u meču:"

#: engines/fibs/kbgfibs.cpp:267
#, kde-format
msgid "Lose match:"
msgstr "Poraz u meču:"

#: engines/fibs/kbgfibs.cpp:269
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"If you want to send a standard greeting to your opponent whenever you start "
"a new match, check this box and write the message into the entry field."
msgstr ""
"Ako želite da pošaljete standardan pozdrav svom protivniku kad god započnete "
"novi meč, popunite ovu kućicu i upišite poruku u polje za unos."

#: engines/fibs/kbgfibs.cpp:273
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"If you want to send a standard message to your opponent whenever you won a "
"match, check this box and write the message into the entry field."
msgstr ""
"Ako želite da pošaljete standardan pozdrav svom protivniku kad god dobijete "
"meč, popunite ovu kućicu i upišite poruku u polje za unos."

#: engines/fibs/kbgfibs.cpp:276
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"If you want to send a standard message to your opponent whenever you lost a "
"match, check this box and write the message into the entry field."
msgstr ""
"Ako želite da pošaljete standardan pozdrav svom protivniku kad god izgubite "
"meč, popunite ovu kućicu i upišite poruku u polje za unos."

#: engines/fibs/kbgfibs.cpp:297
#, kde-format
msgid "&Local"
msgstr "&Lokal"

#: engines/fibs/kbgfibs.cpp:307
#, kde-format
msgid "Server"
msgstr "Server"

#: engines/fibs/kbgfibs.cpp:308
#, kde-format
msgid "Other"
msgstr "Drugo"

#: engines/fibs/kbgfibs.cpp:321
#, kde-format
msgid "Server name:"
msgstr "Ime servera:"

#: engines/fibs/kbgfibs.cpp:322
#, kde-format
msgid "Server port:"
msgstr "Port servera:"

#: engines/fibs/kbgfibs.cpp:323
#, kde-format
msgid "User name:"
msgstr "Korisničko ime:"

#: engines/fibs/kbgfibs.cpp:324
#, kde-format
msgid "Password:"
msgstr "Lozinka:"

#: engines/fibs/kbgfibs.cpp:333
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Enter here the host name of FIBS. With almost absolute certainty this should "
"be \"fibs.com\". If you leave this blank, you will be asked again at "
"connection time."
msgstr ""
"Ovdje unesite ime domaćina FIBS-a. Skoro je potpuno sigurno da je to „fibs."
"com“. Ako ostavite ovo praznim, bićete ponovo upitani pri povezivanju."

#: engines/fibs/kbgfibs.cpp:337
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Enter here the port number of FIBS. With almost absolute certainty this "
"should be \"4321\". If you leave this blank, you will be asked again at "
"connection time."
msgstr ""
"Ovdje unesite broj porta FIBS-a. Skoro je potpuno sigurno da je to „4321“. "
"Ako ostavite ovo praznim, bićete ponovo upitani pri povezivanju."

#: engines/fibs/kbgfibs.cpp:341
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Enter your login on FIBS here. If you do not have a login yet, you should "
"first create an account using the corresponding menu entry. If you leave "
"this blank, you will be asked again at connection time."
msgstr ""
"Ovdje unesite svoj nalog na FIBS-u. Ako još uvijek nemate nalog, trebalo bi "
"da ga napravite koristeći odgovarajuću stavku u meniju. Ako ostavite ovo "
"praznim, bićete ponovo upitani pri povezivanju."

#: engines/fibs/kbgfibs.cpp:345
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Enter your password on FIBS here. If you do not have a login yet, you should "
"first create an account using the corresponding menu entry. If you leave "
"this blank, you will be asked again at connection time. The password will "
"not be visible."
msgstr ""
"Ovdje unesite svoju lozinku na FIBS-u. Ako još uvijek nemate nalog, trebalo "
"bi da ga napravite koristeći odgovarajuću stavku u meniju. Ako ostavite ovo "
"praznim, bićete ponovo upitani pri povezivanju. Lozinka neće biti vidljiva."

#: engines/fibs/kbgfibs.cpp:354
#, kde-format
msgid "Keep connections alive"
msgstr "Održavaj veze u životu"

#: engines/fibs/kbgfibs.cpp:356
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Usually, FIBS drops the connection after one hour of inactivity. When you "
"check this box, %1 will try to keep the connection alive, even if you are "
"not actually playing or chatting. Use this with caution if you do not have "
"flat-rate Internet access."
msgstr ""
"Obično, FIBS prekida vezu posle jednog časa neaktivnosti. Kada popunite ovu "
"kućicu, %1 će pokušati da održava vezu u životu, čak i ako u stvari ne "
"igrate niti ćaskate. Koristite ovo oprezno ako nemate neograničen pristup "
"Internetu."

#: engines/fibs/kbgfibs.cpp:371
#, kde-format
msgid "&Connection"
msgstr "&Veza"

#: engines/fibs/kbgfibs.cpp:385
#, kde-format
msgid "&Buddy List"
msgstr "Lista &drugara"

#: engines/fibs/kbgfibs.cpp:450
#, kde-format
msgctxt "R means resume"
msgid "%1 (R)"
msgstr "%1 (nast.)"

#: engines/fibs/kbgfibs.cpp:451
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"%1 (experience %2, rating %3) wants to resume a saved match with you. If you "
"want to play, use the corresponding menu entry to join (or type 'join %4')."
msgstr ""
"%1 (iskustvo %2, rejting %3) želi da nastavi sačuvan meč sa vama. Ako želite "
"da igrate, upotrijebite odgovarajuću stavku u meniju da biste se pridružili "
"(ili otkucajte „join %4“)."

#: engines/fibs/kbgfibs.cpp:454
#, kde-format
msgid "%1 wants to resume a saved match with you"
msgstr "%1 želi da nastavi sačuvan meč sa vama"

#: engines/fibs/kbgfibs.cpp:457
#, kde-format
msgctxt "U means unlimited"
msgid "%1 (U)"
msgstr "%1 (neogr.)"

#: engines/fibs/kbgfibs.cpp:458
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"%1 (experience %2, rating %3) wants to play an unlimited match with you. If "
"you want to play, use the corresponding menu entry to join (or type 'join "
"%4')."
msgstr ""
"%1 (iskustvo %2, rejting %3) želi da odigra neograničen meč sa vama. Ako "
"želite da igrate, upotrijebite odgovarajuću stavku u meniju da biste se "
"pridružili (ili otkucajte „join %4“)."

#: engines/fibs/kbgfibs.cpp:461
#, kde-format
msgid "%1 has invited you to an unlimited match"
msgstr "%1 vas je pozvao na neograničeni meč"

#: engines/fibs/kbgfibs.cpp:466
#, kde-format
msgctxt ""
"If the format of the (U) and (R) strings is changed, it should also be "
"changed here"
msgid "%1 (%2)"
msgstr "%1 (%2)"

#: engines/fibs/kbgfibs.cpp:467
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"%1 (experience %2, rating %3) wants to play a %4 point match with you. If "
"you want to play, use the corresponding menu entry to join (or type 'join "
"%5')."
msgstr ""
"%1 (iskustvo %2, rejting %3) želi da sa vama odigra meč od %4 poena. Ako "
"želite da igrate, upotrijebite odgovarajuću stavku u meniju da biste se "
"pridružili (ili otkucajte „join %5“)."

#: engines/fibs/kbgfibs.cpp:470
#, kde-format
msgid "%1 has invited you for a %2 point match"
msgstr "%1 vas je pozvao na meč od %2 poena"

#: engines/fibs/kbgfibs.cpp:662
#, kde-format
msgid "Still connected. Log out first?"
msgstr "I dalje ste povezani. Želite li da se prvo odjavite?"

#: engines/fibs/kbgfibs.cpp:662
#, kde-format
msgid "Log Out"
msgstr "Odjavi se"

#: engines/fibs/kbgfibs.cpp:662
#, kde-format
msgid "Stay Connected"
msgstr "Ostani povezan"

#: engines/fibs/kbgfibs.cpp:749
#, kde-format
msgid "Away message"
msgstr "Odlazna poruka"

#: engines/fibs/kbgfibs.cpp:749
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Please type the message that should be displayed to other\n"
"users while you are away."
msgstr ""
"Unesite poruku koja će biti prikazana drugim korisnicima\n"
"dok ste odsutni."

#: engines/fibs/kbgfibs.cpp:902
#, kde-format
msgid "Looking up %1"
msgstr "Tražim %1"

#: engines/fibs/kbgfibs.cpp:913
#, kde-format
msgid "Connecting to %1"
msgstr "Povezujem se na %1"

#: engines/fibs/kbgfibs.cpp:924
#, kde-format
msgid "Error, connection has been refused."
msgstr "Greška, konekcija je odbijena."

#: engines/fibs/kbgfibs.cpp:927
#, kde-format
msgid "Error, nonexistent host or name server down."
msgstr "Greška, nepostojeći domaćin ili je imenski server nedostupan."

#: engines/fibs/kbgfibs.cpp:930
#, kde-format
msgid "Error, reading data from socket."
msgstr "Greška, čitam podatke sa utičnice."

#: engines/fibs/kbgfibs.cpp:933
#, kde-format
msgid "Error, remote host closed connection."
msgstr "Greška,  udaljeni domaćin zatvorio konekciju."

#: engines/fibs/kbgfibs.cpp:936
#, kde-format
msgid "Error, socket timeout exceeded."
msgstr "Greška, vrijeme za utičnicu je prošlo."

#: engines/fibs/kbgfibs.cpp:939
#, kde-format
msgid "Network error"
msgstr "Mrežna greška"

#: engines/fibs/kbgfibs.cpp:1017
#, kde-format
msgid "Connected"
msgstr "Povezan"

#: engines/fibs/kbgfibs.cpp:1067
#, kde-format
msgid "Disconnected."
msgstr "Nepovezan."

#: engines/fibs/kbgfibs.cpp:1093
#, kde-format
msgid "Server name"
msgstr "Naziv servera"

#: engines/fibs/kbgfibs.cpp:1093
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Enter the name of the server you want to connect to.\n"
"This should almost always be \"fibs.com\"."
msgstr ""
"Uvde unesite ime servera na koji želite da se povežete.\n"
"Ovo bi skoro uvijek trebalo da bude „fibs.com“."

#: engines/fibs/kbgfibs.cpp:1105
#, kde-format
msgid "Server port"
msgstr "Port servera"

#: engines/fibs/kbgfibs.cpp:1105
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Enter the port number on the server. It should almost always be \"4321\"."
msgstr ""
"Unesite broj porta na serveru. Ovo bi skoro uvijek trebalo da bude „4321“."

#: engines/fibs/kbgfibs.cpp:1118
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Enter the login you would like to use on the server %1. The login may not\n"
"contain spaces or colons. If the login you choose is not available, you'll "
"later be\n"
"given the opportunity to pick another one.\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"Unesite nalog koji biste željeli da koristite na serveru %1. Nalog ne smije\n"
"sadržati razmake i dvotačke. Ako nalog koji izaberete nije dostupan, "
"kasnije\n"
"će vam biti pružena mogućnost da izaberete neki drugi.\n"
"\n"

#: engines/fibs/kbgfibs.cpp:1124
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Enter your login on the server %1. If you do not have a login, you\n"
"should create one using the corresponding menu option.\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"Unesite podatke za prijavu na serveru %1. Ako nemate podatke za prijavu, "
"trebate\n"
"kreirate jedne koristeći menu opciju.\n"
"\n"

#: engines/fibs/kbgfibs.cpp:1130 engines/fibs/kbgfibs.cpp:1625
#, kde-format
msgid "Login"
msgstr "Prijava"

#: engines/fibs/kbgfibs.cpp:1133
#, kde-format
msgid "The login may not contain spaces or colons!"
msgstr "Nalog ne smije da sadrži razmake i dvotačke!"

#: engines/fibs/kbgfibs.cpp:1148
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Enter the password you would like to use with the login %1\n"
"on the server %2. It may not contain colons.\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"Unesite lozinku koju biste željeli da koristite uz nalog %1\n"
"na serveru %2. Ne smije da sadrži dvotačke.\n"
"\n"

#: engines/fibs/kbgfibs.cpp:1154
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Enter the password for the login %1 on the server %2.\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"Unesite lozinku za nalog %1 na serveru %2.\n"
"\n"

#: engines/fibs/kbgfibs.cpp:1162 engines/fibs/kbgfibs.cpp:1169
#, kde-format
msgid "Connection Password"
msgstr "Šifra za konekciju"

#: engines/fibs/kbgfibs.cpp:1177
#, kde-format
msgid "The password may not contain colons or spaces!"
msgstr "Lozinka ne smje sadržati dvotačke ili razmake!"

#: engines/fibs/kbgfibs.cpp:1452
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"There was a problem with your login and password. You can reenter\n"
"your login and password and try to reconnect."
msgstr ""
"Došlo je do problema sa vašim nalogom i lozinkom. Možete ponovo\n"
"unijeti svoj nalog i lozinku i pokušati da se povežete."

#: engines/fibs/kbgfibs.cpp:1457
#, kde-format
msgid "Wrong Login/Password"
msgstr "Pogrešan nalog/lozinka"

#: engines/fibs/kbgfibs.cpp:1458
#, kde-format
msgid "Reconnect"
msgstr "Poveži se ponovo"

#: engines/fibs/kbgfibs.cpp:1487
#, kde-format
msgid "%1, last logged in from %2 at %3."
msgstr "%1, posljednji put prijavljen sa %2 u %3."

#: engines/fibs/kbgfibs.cpp:1558
#, kde-format
msgid "The moreboards toggle has been set."
msgstr "Postavljen je prekidač za više tabli."

#: engines/fibs/kbgfibs.cpp:1565
#, kde-format
msgid "The notify toggle has been set."
msgstr "Postavljen je prekidač za obavještenja."

#: engines/fibs/kbgfibs.cpp:1572
#, kde-format
msgid "The report toggle has been set."
msgstr "Postavljen je prekidač za izvještaje."

#: engines/fibs/kbgfibs.cpp:1620
#, kde-format
msgid "The selected login is already in use. Please select another one."
msgstr "Odabrana prijava se već koristi. Molimo vas odaberite drugu."

#: engines/fibs/kbgfibs.cpp:1628
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"\n"
"The login may not contain spaces or colons."
msgstr ""
"\n"
"\n"
"Prijava možda neće imati razmake ili kolone."

#: engines/fibs/kbgfibs.cpp:1660
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Your account has been created. Your new login is <u>%1</u>. To fully "
"activate this account, the connection will now be closed - once reconnected, "
"you can start playing backgammon on FIBS."
msgstr ""
"Vaš korisnički nalog je kreiran. Vaša nova prijava je  <u>%1</u>. Da u "
"potpunosti aktivirate korisnički nalog  konekcija će sada biti zatvorena - "
"kad se  konektujete. možete početi igrati  backgammon na FIBS-u."

#: engines/fibs/kbgfibs.cpp:1788
#, kde-format
msgid "%1 (%2) vs. %3 (%4) - game over"
msgstr "%1 (%2) pr. %3 (%4) - kraj igre"

#: engines/fibs/kbgfibs.cpp:1791
#, kde-format
msgid "%1 (%2) vs. %3 (%4) - unlimited match"
msgstr "%1 (%2) pr. %3 (%4) - neograničen meč"

#: engines/fibs/kbgfibs.cpp:1794
#, kde-format
msgid "%1 (%2) vs. %3 (%4) - %5 point match"
msgstr "%1 (%2) pr. %3 (%4) - meč od %5 poena"

#: engines/fibs/kbgfibs.cpp:1820
#, kde-format
msgid "Please make your move"
msgstr "Povucite svoj potez"

#: engines/fibs/kbgfibs.cpp:1833
#, kde-format
msgid "(or use the corresponding menu entry to join the match)"
msgstr "(ili upotrijebite odgovarajuću stavku menija da se pridružite meču)"

#: engines/fibs/kbgfibs.cpp:1887
#, kde-format
msgid "It is your turn to roll the dice or double the cube"
msgstr "Tvoj je red da bacis kocku ili udvostručiš kocku."

#: engines/fibs/kbgfibs.cpp:1948
#, kde-format
msgid "(or use the corresponding menu entry to leave or continue the match)"
msgstr "(ili upotrijebite odgovarajuću stavku menija da nastavite meč)"

#: engines/fibs/kbgfibs.cpp:2044
#, kde-format
msgid "(or use the corresponding menu entry to accept or reject the offer)"
msgstr ""
"(ili upotrijebite odgovarajuću stavku menija da prihvatite ili odbijete "
"ponudu)"

#: engines/fibs/kbgfibs.cpp:2065
#, kde-format
msgid "Sorry, you lost the game."
msgstr "Žao mi je, izgubili ste igru."

#: engines/fibs/kbgfibs.cpp:2073
#, kde-format
msgid "Congratulations, you won the game!"
msgstr "Čestitam, dobili ste igru!"

#: engines/fibs/kbgfibs.cpp:2111
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"You should never set the 'boardstyle' variable by hand! It is vital for "
"proper functioning of this program that it remains set to 3. It has been "
"reset for you."
msgstr ""
"Nikada ne bi trebalo ručno da postavljate promjenljivu „boardstyle“! Ključno "
"je za ispravno funkcionisanje ovog programa da ona ostane postavljena na 3. "
"Zato sam je resetovao za vas."

